## Summary
Seoul will provide a fully free attendance notification service for elementary school students starting from September. This initiative aims to enhance parental awareness and improve student safety by delivering alerts about school attendance.

## Key Points
- The notification service becomes completely free from September.
- The service specifically targets elementary school students in Seoul.
- It provides real-time alerts for school attendance to parents and guardians.
- The initiative is part of broader efforts to increase student safety and parental involvement.


